      "text": "On Feb. 20, 2025, the @USCG detained two illegal aliens during a routine vessel inspection off the coast of Massachusetts. One had an outstanding felony warrant. This highlights the Coast Guard's mission to protect our ports and waterways & strengthen national security.\n \nTogether with @DHSgov & @DeptofDefense, we’ll stop illegal migration & hostile activity before it reaches our border.\n\n@USCGNortheast @USCGLANTAREA \n \nRead more here: https://t.co/ojTpTi9b4Z\n \n#USCoastGuard #NationalSecurity #BorderProtection #HomelandSecurity",
      "text_resolved": "On Feb. 20, 2025, the @USCG detained two illegal aliens during a routine vessel inspection off the coast of Massachusetts. One had an outstanding felony warrant. This highlights the Coast Guard's mission to protect our ports and waterways & strengthen national security.\n \nTogether with @DHSgov & @DeptofDefense, we’ll stop illegal migration & hostile activity before it reaches our border.\n\n@USCGNortheast @USCGLANTAREA \n \nRead more here: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4074595/coast-guard-detains-two-aliens-one-with-an-oustanding-felony-warrant-after-rout/\n \n#USCoastGuard #NationalSecurity #BorderProtection #HomelandSecurity",
