      "text": "The Coast Guard has tripled the number of deployed forces - to include cutters, aircraft, and tactical teams - along the U.S. southern border and maritime approaches. Over the last month, we interdicted over 71,000 lb of illicit drugs. Our counterdrug efforts are directly impacting Transnational Criminal Organizations that are seeking to smuggle fentanyl into the U.S. A vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation. @DHSgov",
